"<strong>Setups in the demo:</strong> Hand timing, one swing; Hand timing, {#} swings; Photogate; A range of lengths; Length read to the bottom of the bob; Big swings, {#}°; Many timings: histogram. A setup sets the timer, the swings per timing, the length, the release angle and where the length is read; it does not clear your readings.",
"The cards under the picture hold the <strong>Length L, as read on the meter stick</strong> (slider, the L −{#} cm, L +{#} cm and L +{#} cm buttons, or click its readout and type a value), the <strong>Release angle θ₀</strong>, the <strong>Timer</strong> (<strong>Hand stopwatch</strong> or <strong>Photogate</strong>), the <strong>Swings per timing N</strong> and where the length is read (<strong>Center of the bob</strong> or <strong>Bottom of the bob</strong>).",
